      "translations": {
        "en": "Al-Ma'mun said: 'And what do I want?' He said: 'Immunity upon honesty.' He said: 'You have immunity.' He said: 'You want the people to say: Ali ibn Musa did not abstain from the world, rather the world abstained from him. Do you not see how he accepted the succession (Wali al-Ahd) out of greed for the Caliphate?'"
